node_modules
.DS_Store
dist
out
# 例外：packages/core/launcher/out 是引导器源码（asar 内布局镜像，非构建产物），必须入库
!packages/core/launcher/out/
!packages/core/launcher/out/**
# 设备 SDK 资产单一来源在 packages/core/src/devices/**/assets/（已跟踪）；应用侧 resources/devices
# 是 scripts/sync-dev-resources.ts（postinstall）覆盖式重建的产物，不入库
apps/*/resources/devices/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.local
unpackage/release
packages/*/lib/
.univa
.eb-cache

